  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/b5e130aebb8f8ab62c6e8a616fcd5d7604c9c901</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/codeMeol/jlpt-kanji-app/commit/b5e130aebb8f8ab62c6e8a616fcd5d7604c9c901"/>
    <title>
        fix: add Kotlin plugin, orphan MainActivity, and proguard rules
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-17T08:38:36Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99194753?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>codeMeol</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/codeMeol</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;fix: add Kotlin plugin, orphan MainActivity, and proguard rules

This resolves the ClassNotFoundException at startup caused by:
- Missing org.jetbrains.kotlin.android plugin in build.gradle.kts
- MainActivity at wrong package path (jlpt_kanji vs jlptkanji)
- Missing proguard-rules.pro causing R8 release build failure

Also adds android_entrypoint_test.dart to prevent regression.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/f6f29b506c800baf3592447d4eda1152e836625e</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/codeMeol/jlpt-kanji-app/commit/f6f29b506c800baf3592447d4eda1152e836625e"/>
    <title>
        fix: correct MainActivity package to match applicationId
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-17T08:25:04Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99194753?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>codeMeol</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/codeMeol</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;fix: correct MainActivity package to match applicationId

- android/app/src/main/kotlin: rename folder jlpt_kanji → jlptkanji
- build.gradle.kts: add missing kotlin-android plugin, fix signing config
- proguard-rules.pro: create empty file (required by AGP R8)
- study_screen.dart: card UI improvements (webview→native, reveal animation)
- test/android_entrypoint_test.dart: prevent this class-not-found regression
- pubspec.lock: update constraints

fixes ClassNotFoundException crash on launch&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
